# Korriban, Uthar's side (K1): the final test kept, Yuthura struck down
# with Uthar. Then Uthar lets the student go, or (Yuthura's plot kept from
# him) turns on them too. Starts from the main route's checkpoint at the
# Star Map:
#   kjk playthrough k1 @kor_starmap data/routes/k1/korriban_uthar_side.route --god
say i'm with you, master uthar
say perhaps we shall meet again        # if he lets you go
say what? but i passed your test!      # if he turns on you
to k39_trg_initacid
fight 30
talk                        # Uthar's word on it: here, he lets you go
fight 30
save kor_us_exam
exit kor39_kor36            # out through the valley and the academy
to k36_trg_shywyrm
exit kor36_kor35
fight 30
exit kor35_kor33b
exit kor33b_kor33a
exit k33_trg_ebonhawk       # aboard
use GalaxyMap               # the Star Maps' coordinates: the Unknown World
travel 9
talk
talk
turrets                  # m12ab: the fighters; the disruptor field, the crash
talk                     # (played before the checkpoint: no save in a
talk                     # minigame)
save kor_us_unknown_world
